    "$6-5(3x-1)=-9+5(4x+2)$": "$\\begin{aligned} 6-5(3x-1) &= -9+5(4x+2) \\\\ 6-15x+5 &= -9+20x+10 \\\\ -15x-20x &= -9+10-6-5 \\\\ -35x &= -10 \\\\ x &= \\frac{-10}{-35} \\\\ \\mathbf{x} &\\mathbf{= +\\tfrac{2}{7}} \\end{aligned}$",
    "$6(x+2)-3=4x-2(4-5x)$": "$\\begin{aligned} 6(x+2)-3 &= 4x-2(4-5x) \\\\ 6x+12-3 &= 4x-8+10x \\\\ 6x-4x-10x &= -8-12+3 \\\\ -8x &= -17 \\\\ x &= \\frac{-17}{-8} \\\\ \\mathbf{x} &\\mathbf{= \\tfrac{17}{8}} \\end{aligned}$",
    "$-2+3(4+7x)=1-3(x-6)$": "$\\begin{aligned} -2+3(4+7x) &= 1-3(x-6) \\\\ -2+12+21x &= 1-3x+18 \\\\ 21x+3x &= 1+18+2-12 \\\\ 24x &= 9 \\\\ x &= \\frac{9}{24} \\\\ \\mathbf{x} &\\mathbf{= \\tfrac{3}{8}} \\end{aligned}$",
