    "$4(-3x+2)^2+3(-1+5x)-6=$": "$\\begin{aligned} 4[(-4x+5)(2-5x)+6x]-3 &= \\\\ 4[-8x+20x^2+10-25x+6x]-3 &= \\\\ -32x+80x^2+40-100x+24x-3 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{80x^2-108x+37} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 4(-3x+2)^2+3(-1+5x)-6 &= \\\\ 4(-3x+2)(-3x+2)-3+15x-6 &= \\\\ 4(9x^2-6x-6x+4)-3+15x-6 &= \\\\ 4(9x^2-12x+4)-3+15x-6 &= \\\\ 36x^2-48x+16-3+15x-6 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{36x^2-33x+7} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 2[(-3x+2)(4-5x)+3x]-5 &= \\\\ 2[-12x+15x^2+8-10x+3x]-5 &= \\\\ -24x+30x^2+16-20x+6x-5 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{30x^2-38x+11} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 5(2x-1)^2+4(-3+6x)-3 &= \\\\ 5(2x-1)(2x-1)-12+24x-3 &= \\\\ 5(4x^2-2x-2x+1)-12+24x-3 &= \\\\ 5(4x^2-4x+1)-12+24x-3 &= \\\\ 20x^2-20x+5-12+24x-3 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{20x^2+4x-10} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 3[(-2x+3)(5-4x)+2x]-5 &= \\\\ 3[-10x+8x^2+15-12x+2x]-5 &= \\\\ -30x+24x^2+45-36x+6x-5 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{24x^2-60x+40} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 5(-4x+3)^2-2(3-2x)-4 &= \\\\ 5(-4x+3)(-4x+3)-6+4x-4 &= \\\\ 5(16x^2-12x-12x+9)-6+4x-4 &= \\\\ 5(16x^2-24x+9)-6+4x-4 &= \\\\ 80x^2-120x+45-6+4x-4 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{80x^2-116x+35} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 5[(2x-3)(1-3x)+4x]-2 &= \\\\ 5[2x-6x^2-3+9x+4x]-2 &= \\\\ 10x-30x^2-15+45x+20x-2 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{-30x^2+75x-17} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 2(-2x+4)^2+3(-5x+3)-1 &= \\\\ 2(-2x+4)(-2x+4)-15x+9-1 &= \\\\ 2(4x^2-8x-8x+16)-15x+9-1 &= \\\\ 2(4x^2-16x+16)-15x+9-1 &= \\\\ 8x^2-32x+32-15x+9-1 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{8x^2-47x+40} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 3[(-5x+2)(3-2x)+7x]-4 &= \\\\ 3[10x^2-19x+6+7x]-4 &= \\\\ 3[10x^2-12x+6]-4 &= \\\\ 30x^2-36x+18-4 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{30x^2-36x+14} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 4(3x-2)^2+2(-4+3x)-7 &= \\\\ 4(9x^2-12x+4)-8+6x-7 &= \\\\ 36x^2-48x+16-8+6x-7 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{36x^2-42x+1} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 4[(3x-2)(1-4x)+5x]-3 &= \\\\ 4[3x-12x^2-2+8x+5x]-3 &= \\\\ 12x-48x^2-8+32x+20x-3 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{-48x^2+64x-11} & \\end{aligned}$ $\\begin{aligned} 3(-2x+5)^2+4(-3+2x)-8 &= \\\\ 3(-2x+5)(-2x+5)-12+8x-8 &= \\\\ 3(4x^2-10x-10x+25)-12+8x-8 &= \\\\ 3(4x^2-20x+25)-12+8x-8 &= \\\\ 12x^2-60x+75-12+8x-8 &= \\\\ \\mathbf{12x^2-52x+55} & \\end{aligned}$"
